# Deny local credentials and generated files at every nesting level.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.ssh
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.bak
**/*.log
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vite-cache
**/.npm-cache
**/.DS_Store
.agents
.github
docs
